  <item>
    <title>#24. TikTok“难民”潮：首先您压根儿不是难民好吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678e0f869420ede9d15768e4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678e0f869420ede9d15768e4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Jan 2025 09:08:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在2025年第一期播客来聊聊最近的小红书(REDNOTE)的“洋务运动”。果然这个世界感受到了冥王星进入了水瓶座的能量，我们迎来了首轮世界上两个最有存在感的国家网民的精神碰撞……</span></p><span></span><h2><em><span>SHOW NOTES</span></em></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> “激进派“青豆和“温和派”咖喱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 我为什么不喜欢用“难民”形容这些洋抖人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> 小红书一些网友的“受宠若惊”让我很不适&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="312">05:12</a> 小红书平台对中文创作者和外国创作者的“双标”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a> 中西网友一些积极正面的碰撞与文化交流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a> 很难有现实的桃花源，只有想象的彼岸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="848">14:08</a> 欧洲gai溜子荷兰人也来小红书凑热闹了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="969">16:09</a> 最好笑的是在中国默默耕耘了几年混成“老内”的老外，被一些random老外抢走了流量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> 冥王星进入水瓶座，这个世界没什么不可能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1188">19:48</a> 小红书网友请先了解一下什么叫做“白人特权”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1313">21:53</a> 热闹过后都是大家再次回归一些朴实的，利我的，价值观</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>MUSIC</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><em><span>国际歌</span></em><span> - 唐朝乐队</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>CONTACT</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><span>小红书：咖喱青豆</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：咖喱青豆</span></p><span></span><p><span>找咖喱玩儿：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>ig: uiigo</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小红书：uiigo</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>找青豆玩儿：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>ig: favyu_</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小红书：edamameeee</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
