  <item>
    <title>#22. 不如算命，谈恋爱不如算命</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67625d9f7d8426f692050471</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67625d9f7d8426f692050471</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Dec 2024 05:37:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>作为各自朋友圈里最神叨的两个人，聊聊这些年我们玩玄学的感悟。</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>SHOW NOTES</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">02:31</a> 人无助的时候就会对非唯物主义投降</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> 来自唯物主义的凝视：“我倒要看看你能算出什么”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> 不同的算命先生却得出了我感情上相同的结论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> “空亡年”就是要放过自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">19:38</a> 人生就如四季，我们本身就是在四季中循环</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 思考死亡，走出漫长的grief</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 好像人生每个重大决定都是我的身体替我做的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">32:48</a> 东方五行与西方星盘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2393">39:53</a> 社交新名片：你的星盘是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2938">48:58</a> 星盘就是你自己的“使用说明书”</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>MUSIC</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><span>May Rain - 窦靖童</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>CONTACT US</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><span>XHS: 咖喱青豆</span></p><span></span><p><span>VX公众号：咖喱青豆</span></p>]]></description>
