  <item>
    <title>#21. 也许小叶铁梅才是必修课，男人只是课间十分钟</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67444f1e8d1233fb0de64baa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67444f1e8d1233fb0de64baa</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Nov 2024 10:34:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>周末和咖喱还有我们的朋友丝瓜去看了《好东西》，情理之中意料之外，一个中年大哥在影片酣然入睡，此刻这个电影的含金量达到了顶峰……</span></p><span></span><p><span>在观看电影的过程中我们惊人发现“小叶”这个角色和咖喱的相似性，“铁梅”和青豆的相似性……i can't help wondering...是不是每个小叶都会有一个铁梅这样的朋友？她们彼此支持，成长，解放。也许小叶和铁梅才是我们的必修课，男人只是我们的课间十分钟：）</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>SHOW NOTES</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 缺爱的小叶：爱道歉，爱囤物，爱为伤害自己的人找理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a> 通过讨好别人获得的短暂满足感，需要持续讨好才能获得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> 压抑久了，我很难感受到当下的情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> 关系里看似冷静的一方其实一直在偷偷减你分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1643">27:23</a> 关系里需要“危机感”还是“我是爱你的，你是自由的”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2067">34:27</a> 友谊具有“排他性”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2184">36:24</a> 人到中年，异性关系可能真的不是必修课了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 当女性拥有不惧怕一切的勇气，她就是自由的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2788">46:28</a> 当一个男人对女性的全部了解源于一些日本男导演的动作爱情片……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3130">52:10</a> 完美从来不重要，重要的是一直成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3226">53:46</a> 小男孩儿欺负小女孩儿，就是纯欺负，并不因为是“喜欢她”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3414">56:54</a> 题外话：上海的feminine气质 vs 北京的muscular气质</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>MUSIC</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><span>She's My Witch (1958) - Kip Tyler</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>来找我们玩儿～</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><span>//咖喱：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>xhs: Uiigo</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>ig: uiigo</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>//青豆</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>xhs: 段青豆edamame</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>ig: favyu_</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlZn2r2UAyNQiK452KiBMJCVGxeP.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>⬆截图出自美剧《欲望都市》</span><em><span>SEX AND THE CITY</span></em></p><span></span><h2><br></h2>]]></description>
