  <item>
    <title>#19. 闭经的恐惧，中年人的情欲和友谊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670e99870d2f24f289607539</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670e99870d2f24f289607539</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天请来了我们的朋友丝瓜（是的我们都是菜名儿）来和我们聊聊对中女时代的思考。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>SHOW NOTES</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> 中老年人的八卦时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">12:03</a> 如何在三岁完成对男人的祛魅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1232">20:32</a> 对闭经的恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1541">25:41</a> 闭经后是真正的自由吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2487">41:27</a> 西班牙海滩的老太太</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> 独生子女老了怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2996">49:56</a> 脑暴一下三个人抚养一个小孩</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>MOVIE &amp; BOOK</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Gloria </span></em><span>葛洛莉亚 (2013) 导演/Sebastián Lelio</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Good Luck to You, Leo Grande </span></em><span>祝你好运，里奥·格兰德 (2022) 导演/Sophie Hyde</span></p><span></span><p><span>หลานม่า 姥姥的外孙 导演/Pat Boonnitipat</span></p><span></span><p><span>《闭经记》作者/伊藤比吕美</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>MUSIC</span></strong></em></p><span></span><h1><span>Young and Beautiful - Lana Del Rey</span></h1><span></span><h1><br></h1>]]></description>
