  <item>
    <title>#18. 当男人问「你有过外国男朋友吗」时，他在想些什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e867705ca6d0ace35de228</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e867705ca6d0ace35de228</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Sep 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>台风天，聊聊相亲故事，说说八卦，骂骂人</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期片头和片尾的歌是青豆最近最爱的，强烈推荐！</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>SHOW NOTES</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:27</a> let's catch up 一个过得充实规律，一个迷茫不平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">07:34</a> 中男是不是都有个做皇帝的春秋大梦？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 「没交往过外国男朋友」是中女新的贞节牌坊？（男的有外国女友就是为国争光）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a> 相亲越多，我就更爱我自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2001">33:21</a> 当女人也厌女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2802">46:42</a> 自己玩儿的快乐~</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>MUSIC</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Bad Things</span></em><span> - Jace Everett</span></p>]]></description>
