  <item>
    <title>#17.《我的天才女友》才不是意大利版的《七月与安生》好吧？？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a9fc557349f7a557d062ad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a9fc557349f7a557d062ad</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Jul 2024 08:56:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期聊聊《那不勒斯四部曲》，绝对好看！顺便实名给某🐧视频的垃圾文案一个大锤锤。</span></p><span></span><p><span>SHOW NOTES |</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a>《我的天才女友》才不是意大利版的塑料姐妹花好吧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">08:53</a> 不要拿内🐟电视剧水平和这个剧对比可以吗？求求了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">08:53</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a> 那不勒斯，和我的中国三线小城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1195">19:55</a> Lila and Lenu 角色分析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1195">19:55</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> 阶级与婚姻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">31:17</a> 你的女性主义，我的女性主义，好像不一样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">31:17</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2171">36:11</a> 50年过去了，男人还是那个样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2171">36:11</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2561">42:41</a> 友谊与道德</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2561">42:41</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2888">48:08</a> 30岁正式思考衰老与死亡的年纪</span></p><span></span><p><span>MUSIC |</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=OLAK5uy_n7Cylp2UP3RsBGvVE15F_JfzydnNSq0ys&amp;playnext=1&amp;index=1" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=OLAK5uy_n7Cylp2UP3RsBGvVE15F_JfzydnNSq0ys&amp;playnext=1&amp;index=1"><span>My Brilliant Friend (TV Series Soundtrack)</span></a><span> </span><em><span>Whispers </span></em><span>- Max Richter</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnVlHHhvDba_XBJ2uiIxUoUfKH__.m4a" length="47084929" type="audio/mp4"/>
