  <item>
    <title>#16. 荷兰留子回国续集：我更快乐了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669127318fcadceb90e2a72b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669127318fcadceb90e2a72b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 Jul 2024 12:53:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期节目是几个月前一期播客的续集 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65ff072a1519139e4f280fe1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65ff072a1519139e4f280fe1"><strong><span>ep.11 十年荷兰留子决定回到中国</span></strong></a><strong><span> </span></strong><span>（点击链接或者扫描下面的二维码可以收听哦~）</span></p><span></span><p><span>消失了很久的咖喱回来了！这期我们聊聊她从荷兰辞职回中国后的「牛马」生活。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>来社媒找我们玩儿：REDBOOK/VX公众号🔍咖喱青豆</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>SHOW NOTES |</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">00:01:02</a> 回国三个月，咖喱更开心了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">00:02:35</a> 在国内，工作变成了我生活的最高优先级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">00:05:36</a> 老中人连上班加班都像在奋战高考……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">00:10:55</a> 荷兰和中国的工作环境和资源调动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1016">00:16:56</a> 在国内工作更多的是「皮肉之苦」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1607">00:26:47</a> 国内最让人幸福的还是朋友和安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">00:33:11</a> 父母持证上岗，开始催婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2192">00:36:32</a> 老中人相亲现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2358">00:39:18</a> 留子回国要学会censor自己的嘴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2443">00:40:43</a> 但是中国人是这个世界上最resilient的民族了吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">00:43:20</a> 青豆：实名鄙视LITTLE REDBOOK</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2761">00:46:01</a> 学会温柔的revolution</span></p><span></span><p><span>MUSIC | </span><em><span>Bored</span></em><span> - Laufey</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg15LnGE7LdvPTxlM2rhROsl7ec2.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luDvSCpaRzKUlIQ2GJoFXKnCec3D.m4a" length="47663872" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu9JH3UgxqWeQJdgYVzAuDvZAXh8.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>#15. 终于回国了：兵荒马乱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666f091eb6a84127292d9bbc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666f091eb6a84127292d9bbc</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Jun 2024 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello大家，这期只有青豆，没有咖喱（咖喱苦命加班呢~）</span></p><span></span><p><span>逃难般离开了荷兰，回到了我的东北三线小城，一周之内我几乎经历了人世间各种情感：失而复得的从惊到喜，疾病与生死一线，老友重逢的感慨，朋友新婚的喜悦…… 只想说做人真的好辛苦</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>来社媒找我们玩儿</span></strong><span>：REDBOOK/VX公众号🔍</span><strong><span>咖喱青豆</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes |</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:00:56</a> 终于离！职！了！我的世界从此再也没有牛鬼蛇神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">00:06:12</a> 回国飞机的当天猫！丢！了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">00:13:30</a> 从找猫过程当中看男人和女人的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">00:15:01</a> 飞回东北的航班已经让我感受到快乐了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">00:17:25</a> 回家和老爸的第一个争吵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1199">00:19:59</a> 理解父亲的在抗癌路上的情绪但坚决拒绝他的投射</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1274">00:21:14</a> 分享疗愈师推荐的情绪管理方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">00:26:00</a> 感受医院里的生命流逝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">00:31:59</a> 回国第一周小结</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music | </span><em><span>flaws</span></em><span> - Thomas Ng</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhLZOOQBnWqDfjLzWbrpWbC1EfsI.m4a" length="34486138" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu9JH3UgxqWeQJdgYVzAuDvZAXh8.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
